</div>
<div id="alg1.l26" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l26.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">26:</span></span>
              
              
               Compute variational gradients using Eqs. <a href="#A1.E21" title="Equation 21 ‣ A.6.1 Variational Parameter Updates ‣ A.6 Detailed Gradient Derivations ‣ Appendix A Computational Complexity Analysis ‣ Scalable Variational Bayesian Fine-Tuning of LLMs via Orthogonalized Low-Rank Adapters" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">21</span></a>–<a href="#A1.E22" title="Equation 22 ‣ A.6.1 Variational Parameter Updates ‣ A.6 Detailed Gradient Derivations ‣ Appendix A Computational Complexity Analysis ‣ Scalable Variational Bayesian Fine-Tuning of LLMs via Orthogonalized Low-Rank Adapters" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l27" class="ltx_listingline">
