<div id="alg1.l29" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l29.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">29:</span></span>
              
              
               Project <math id="alg1.l29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{S}_{c,t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐒</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{S}_{c,t+1}</annotation></semantics></math> to positive definite cone if necessary

</div>
<div id="alg1.l30" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l30.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">30:</span></span>
              
              
