</section>
<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Memory Usage and Runtime</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate the computational efficiency of different uncertainty quantification methods on the ARC-E dataset. All experiments use a training batch size of 4, inference batch size of 4, LoRA rank <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=8</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=16" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=16</annotation></semantics></math>, and sequence length of 300.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T3" class="ltx_table">
